  "statement": "As GreenAgent, I maintain that sustainability is essential in our library management system. I continue to oppose EFF-02's proposal for 10 simultaneous borrows, as it conflicts with GRN-07's goal of prioritizing e-books to reduce physical resource consumption. I fully support the synthesis regarding energy-efficient overdue notifications, ensuring we minimize resource impact while maintaining accountability. Additionally, I agree to rely on TRU-01 for authentication to eliminate redundancy with SAF-06. It is crucial that we balance efficiency and sustainability in our decisions.",
